  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"2339\">\n<p data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1997\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1995\">Positive (Pathogenic/Likely Pathogenic Variant):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2339\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2087\">\n<p data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2087\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Confirms <strong data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2055\">hereditary breast cancer susceptibility</strong> (e.g., BRCA1/2, PALB2, TP53).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2280\">\n<p data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2132\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Guides <strong data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2129\">risk-reduction strategies</strong>:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2280\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2178\">\n<p data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2178\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Enhanced screening (MRI/mammography)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2223\">\n<p data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2223\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Prophylactic surgery (if indicated)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2280\">\n<p data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2280\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Targeted therapies (e.g., <strong data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2276\">PARP inhibitors</strong>).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2339\">\n<p data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2339\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2304\">Family members</strong> should be offered cascade testing.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2500\">\n<p data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2390\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2388\">Variant of Uncertain Significance (VUS):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2500\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2440\">\n<p data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2440\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Clinical significance not yet established.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2500\">\n<p data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2500\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Recommend <strong data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2499\">periodic review and segregation studies</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2636\">\n<p data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2520\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2518\">Negative:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2636\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2557\">\n<p data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2557\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">No pathogenic variants found.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2636\">\n<p data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2636\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Does not rule out cancer predisposition from non-tested or unknown genes.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
